    {
      "date": "Jun 02 2026",
      "text": "Application (25A1314) for stay presented to Justice Thomas and by him referred to the Court is granted. The May 26,2026, order of the United States District Court for the Northern District of Alabama, case Nos. 2:21–cv–1530 and 2:21–cv–1291 is stayed pending the timely docketing of the appeal in this Court. Should the jurisdictional statement be timely filed, this order shall remain in effect pending this Court’s action on the appeal. If the appeal is dismissed, or the judgment affirmed, this order shall terminate automatically. In the event jurisdiction is noted or postponed, this order will remain in effect pending the sending down of the judgment of this Court. (Detached Opinion ) Justice Sotomayor, Justice Kagan and Justice Jackson dissent. Opinion per curiam. (Detached Opinion )",
